pe.team.usage=/projecte_team <create|invite|members|kick|leave|transfer_owner|settings|accept|decline>\n/projecte_team create [名字] - 创建团队(默认名: <玩家名> team)\n/projecte_team invite <玩家> - 邀请玩家加入团队(支持离线玩家;无团队时自动创建)\n/projecte_team accept - 接受待处理的邀请\n/projecte_team decline - 拒绝待处理的邀请\n/projecte_team members - 列出团队成员\n/projecte_team kick <玩家> - 踢出成员(仅队长;支持离线成员)\n/projecte_team leave - 离开团队\n/projecte_team transfer_owner <玩家> - 转让队长(仅队长)\n/projecte_team settings share_emc <true|false> - 设置是否共享 EMC(默认: true)\n/projecte_team settings share_knowledge <true|false> - 设置是否共享知识(默认: true)
pe.team.create.usage=/projecte_team create [名字]
pe.team.create.already=你已经在一个团队中了!
pe.team.create.success=团队 "%s" 已创建!你现在是队长。
